---
source: tests-e2e/tests/formatting.rs
---
$ iris format --write --check
status: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
error: the argument '--check' cannot be used with '--write'

Usage: iris format [FLAGS]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ iris format --write --file -
status: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
error: cannot use --write with standard input
$ iris format src/Main.purs
status: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
error: unexpected argument 'src/Main.purs' found

Usage: iris format [FLAGS]

For more information, try '--help'.
$ iris format --file src/Main.purs --file src/Other.purs
status: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
error: multiple files require --write or --check
$ iris format --width 0
status: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
error: invalid formatting options: line width must be positive
$ iris format --indent 0
status: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
error: invalid formatting options: indent width must be between 1 and 65535 spaces
$ iris format --indent 65536
status: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
error: invalid formatting options: indent width must be between 1 and 65535 spaces
